  "_response_shape": "JSON-RPC 2.0. The flight payload is NOT top-level JSON: it lives in result.content[0].text as a Python repr() string (single quotes) prefixed with \"Flight details: \". Some deployments stream SSE (text/event-stream) with \"data: {...}\" lines. The parser tries json.loads first, then ast.literal_eval on the {...} substring (spec #70: literal only, never executed).",
